{"src":"tr","tgt":"en","rate":24000,"room_opened_ms_before":1500,"err":"","clip_ms":201500,"events":[{"kind":"hello","type":"hello","lang":"en","src":"tr","rate":24000,"mode":"utterance","edition":"nonprofit","context":true},{"kind":"input","t":8603.540214,"text":"Schengen bölgesi bu anlamda az çok tek bir ülke gibi işliyor."},{"kind":"text","t":9182.553931,"text":"In this sense, the Schengen area functions more or less like a single country."},{"kind":"audio","t":9269.1079,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":420,"off":1140},{"kind":"audio","t":9274.05033,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":150,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":9279.058559000001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":9283.530077,"samples":31896,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":730},{"kind":"input","t":16951.705082999997,"text":"Mekke'nin kuzeyindeki dağların birinin tepesinde yer alan mağara, dünyanın geri kalanından tamamen izolidir."},{"kind":"text","t":17819.825389999998,"text":"The cave, located on the summit of one of the mountains north of Mecca, is completely isolated from the rest of the world."},{"kind":"audio","t":17923.260984999997,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":17928.298573999997,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":17933.762185,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":17938.826543,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":17944.244974999998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":17949.328093,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":800},{"kind":"audio","t":17949.755426,"samples":792,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":27852.575918,"text":"İnsanlar asla bir kalem tıraşa yaklaşmak zorunda kalmadan artık bilgisayar ekranlarından mesajlar yazıyor."},{"kind":"text","t":28499.226199999997,"text":"People now write messages on computer screens without ever having to get close to a pencil shaver."},{"kind":"audio","t":28595.577129999998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":28597.008826999998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":28598.339925,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":40,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":28599.998018,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":28601.574243,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1040},{"kind":"audio","t":28601.907617999997,"samples":8360,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":42607.989195,"text":"Ağır vergilendirmeye tabi ülkelere seyahat eden yolcular özellikle alkollü iç içeceklerden ve tütün mamullerinden benzer önemli ölçüde tasarruf edebilir."},{"kind":"text","t":43277.801172,"text":"Passengers traveling to countries with high taxes can save significantly, especially on alcoholic beverages and tobacco products."},{"kind":"audio","t":43383.263783999995,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":43388.520779,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":43393.877112999995,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1310},{"kind":"audio","t":43399.134668,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":40,"off":900},{"kind":"audio","t":43404.383393,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":50,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":43409.748276,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":43415.293126,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1050},{"kind":"audio","t":43415.596211,"samples":5824,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":48844.029275,"text":"Bitkiler besinlerini güneşten fotozenitezle elde ederler. Gölgede sağlarlar."},{"kind":"text","t":49540.563699,"text":"Plants obtain their nutrients from the sun through photosynthesis. They get them in the shade as well."},{"kind":"audio","t":49639.34871,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":49644.620924999996,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1260},{"kind":"audio","t":49649.986167999996,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":260,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":49651.584502,"samples":15096,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":60},{"kind":"audio","t":49729.476941,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":49734.093646,"samples":32032,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":750},{"kind":"input","t":59387.687932,"text":"Hastane, diğer insanların muhtemel enfeksiyonunu önlemek için hastayı diğerlerinden tecrit etmeyip içeren bir enfeksiyon kontrol protokolü izledi."},{"kind":"text","t":60142.196188,"text":"The hospital followed an infection control protocol that did not isolate the patient from others to prevent potential infection of other people."},{"kind":"audio","t":60248.131033,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":60253.439197,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":60258.558024,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":60263.873677999996,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":60269.080054,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":60274.448347,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":60279.993107,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1030},{"kind":"audio","t":60280.304402,"samples":7024,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":68108.00166600001,"text":"Yapılan iş genelde teorikti. Fakat program Sagittarius galaksisine yönelik gözlemleri taklit etmek için yazılmıştı."},{"kind":"text","t":68711.104693,"text":"The work done was mostly theoretical. But the program was written to simulate observations of the Sagittarius galaxy."},{"kind":"audio","t":68793.76539500001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":68799.229047,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1230},{"kind":"audio","t":68799.88616600001,"samples":10664,"rate":24000},{"kind":"audio","t":68879.28883100001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":68880.56767,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1260},{"kind":"audio","t":68882.118935,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":68883.66986000001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1140},{"kind":"audio","t":68884.02087400001,"samples":9928,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":82472.93920400001,"text":"Barcelona'nın resmi dilleri Katalanca ve İspanyolcadır. Halkın yaklaşık yarısı Katalanca konuşmayı tercih etmekte, büyük çoğunluğu bu dili anlamakta ve neredeyse herkes İspanyolca bilmektedir."},{"kind":"text","t":83294.432816,"text":"The official languages of Barcelona are Catalan and Spanish. About half of the population prefers to speak Catalan, the vast majority understands it, and almost everyone knows Spanish."},{"kind":"audio","t":83384.85320200001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":83389.99967800001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1050},{"kind":"audio","t":83395.50942900001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":50,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":83398.114887,"samples":19296,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":240},{"kind":"audio","t":83487.78998500001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":83493.08113,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1310},{"kind":"audio","t":83498.10538800001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":83503.55776000001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":83508.94232300001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":83514.36649500001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":83516.89734400001,"samples":20592,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":290},{"kind":"input","t":94218.225779,"text":"Bazı bölgelerde suyu bir dakika kaynatmak yeterlidir. Diğer bölgelerde ise suyun kaynaması için birkaç dakika daha gerekir."},{"kind":"text","t":94850.477614,"text":"In some areas, boiling water for a minute is sufficient. In other regions, it takes a few more minutes for the water to boil."},{"kind":"audio","t":94936.108298,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1310},{"kind":"audio","t":94939.50573300001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":300,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":94943.35395100001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":910},{"kind":"audio","t":94943.571087,"samples":4296,"rate":24000},{"kind":"audio","t":95021.51412600001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":420,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":95026.321358,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":95031.774309,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":95033.773807,"samples":16896,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":100},{"kind":"input","t":107296.45646700001,"text":"Bitkiler doğal bir ortamda oldukları zaman en iyi halleriyle görünürler. Bu nedenle sadece bir örneği bile almanın cazibesine direnin."},{"kind":"text","t":107832.562518,"text":"Plants look their best when they are in their natural environment. Therefore, resist the temptation to even take just one example."},{"kind":"audio","t":107919.78979600001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":107924.862554,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":107930.236997,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":790},{"kind":"audio","t":107930.518052,"samples":3096,"rate":24000},{"kind":"audio","t":108005.600907,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":108010.661105,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":108016.17670600001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":108018.37766000001,"samples":18696,"rate":24000,"on":50,"off":170},{"kind":"input","t":114379.366207,"text":"1920'lerde çoğu vatandaş ve ulusun egemen tavrı barışçılık ve izolasyondu."},{"kind":"text","t":115185.659945,"text":"In the 1920s, the dominant attitude of most citizens and nations was pacifism and isolationism."},{"kind":"audio","t":115289.20396900001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":430,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":115294.52261300001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1300},{"kind":"audio","t":115299.94859500001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":20,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":115305.054072,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":115310.477324,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":115315.933076,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":870},{"kind":"audio","t":115316.085024,"samples":3192,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":125978.990801,"text":"Mosazor döneminin doruklarındaki yırtıcısıydı. Dolayısıyla diğer Mosazorlardan başka hiçbir şeyden korkmuyordu."},{"kind":"text","t":126519.721948,"text":"It was the predator at the peak of the Mosazor era. Therefore, he feared nothing but other Mosazors."},{"kind":"audio","t":126605.126745,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1310},{"kind":"audio","t":126610.40694,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":110,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":126614.424255,"samples":28064,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":560},{"kind":"audio","t":126681.705145,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":126686.882411,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":126689.992711,"samples":23864,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":440},{"kind":"input","t":137196.971602,"text":"Paraguay, Asensio'nun 1537'de kurulmasından bu yana yerli kimliğini ve karakterini büyük ölçüde kurmayı başardı."},{"kind":"text","t":138053.443118,"text":"Since its founding in 1537 by Asensio, Paraguay has largely managed to establish its indigenous identity and character."},{"kind":"audio","t":138163.85046000002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":138169.112155,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":138174.272562,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":990},{"kind":"audio","t":138179.573996,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":170,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":138184.957869,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":138190.292212,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":138195.39734,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1040},{"kind":"audio","t":138195.752844,"samples":8224,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":145520.433571,"text":"Hastalık domuzlar tarafından taşınır. Daha sonra sivrisinekler yoluyla insanlara geçer."},{"kind":"text","t":145902.970338,"text":"The disease is carried by pigs. It then spreads to humans through mosquitoes."},{"kind":"audio","t":145983.418436,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":380,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":145987.953313,"samples":32032,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":800},{"kind":"audio","t":146071.884284,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":146077.126839,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1350},{"kind":"audio","t":146078.192602,"samples":13064,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":155751.280682,"text":"Çoğu modern araştırma teleskobu uygun atmosfer koşullarına sahip ücra bölgelerdeki devasa tesislerdir."},{"kind":"text","t":156334.240105,"text":"Most modern research telescopes are massive facilities located in remote areas with suitable atmospheric conditions."},{"kind":"audio","t":156437.51585300002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":430,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":156442.66445,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":156448.099732,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1340},{"kind":"audio","t":156453.43692500002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":120,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":156458.634081,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":156463.995505,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":156466.907588,"samples":21792,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":320},{"kind":"input","t":163220.19400400002,"text":"İnsanlar ülkeye dönen yolculara karşı sabırlı ve anlayışlı olmaları gerektiğini öngöremeyebilir."},{"kind":"text","t":163830.364577,"text":"People might not realize they need to be patient and understanding toward travelers returning to the country."},{"kind":"audio","t":163919.35334600002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":163922.430386,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":163925.537726,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":163928.855882,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":163932.195918,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1130},{"kind":"audio","t":163932.392555,"samples":8960,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":170134.514494,"text":"Dolayısıyla bilgilendirmenin basit bir şekilde bir etiket olarak eklenmesi muhtemeldir."},{"kind":"text","t":170688.56828500002,"text":"Therefore, it’s likely that the information will simply be added as a label."},{"kind":"audio","t":170778.39222100002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":420,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":170783.739314,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":170789.094488,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":170793.146482,"samples":28296,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":570},{"kind":"input","t":176259.159227,"text":"Fakat kuşlar hakkında hala dinozor gibi görünen pek çok şey vardır."},{"kind":"text","t":176724.498654,"text":"But there are still many things about birds that seem like dinosaurs."},{"kind":"audio","t":176806.89798,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":176808.40057600001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":176809.837183,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1280},{"kind":"audio","t":176810.213847,"samples":12096,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":184444.629509,"text":"Neredeyse tamamı güvenle yüzülebilen kulunlu plajlardır."},{"kind":"text","t":184825.51031800002,"text":"They are almost all safe beaches suitable for swimming."},{"kind":"audio","t":184909.759906,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":184915.009408,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":184918.826385,"samples":27464,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":520},{"kind":"input","t":189791.059244,"text":"Ve çoğunda Puhutu Kava ağacı tarafından sağlanan gölgelikler vardır."},{"kind":"text","t":190344.16889600002,"text":"And most of them have shade provided by Puhutu kava trees."},{"kind":"audio","t":190428.379064,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":190433.470639,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":190438.755191,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":190440.42396400002,"samples":13896,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":10},{"kind":"input","t":200780.91206,"text":"İki yetişkin çocukla evli olan Duval, hikayenin ilişkili olduğu Miller üzerinde büyük bir intiba bırakmadı."},{"kind":"text","t":201581.506512,"text":"Married to two adult children, Duval didn’t make a strong impression on Miller, who is connected to the story."},{"kind":"audio","t":201676.288344,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":201680.86219800002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":201686.189579,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":201691.453231,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1100},{"kind":"audio","t":201696.741873,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":110,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":201700.011689,"samples":21560,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":270},{"kind":"close","t":211802.506977,"code":1005}]}